 askgate  studio.local                  ● here · auto   3 need you · 2 working · 2 waiting   ● live

── Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   j k  ↑ ↓      move
   y             allow once
   a             allow for the rest of this session
   n             deny (type an optional reason, enter sends)
   enter         attach to a wrapped session, or show more detail
   e             explain why a session is in its state
   p             presence: auto → here → away
   r             reload from the daemon
   ?             this help · q quits

── Presence ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   here          requests show in the agent's own dialog, in its terminal
   away          requests are held and sent to your paired phone
   auto          here or away from keyboard and mouse idle time

   From any shell: askgate approve <id> · askgate deny <id> -m "why" · askgate ls










 esc back   q quit
